<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; max-width: 640px;">
    <p>Dear {{data.recipientName}},</p>

    <p>
        Please find the pre-filled forms for the Bank Guarantee below. The purpose of this BG is
        {{data.bgPurpose}}.
    </p>

    <p>
        {{#if data.referenceValue}}<strong>{{data.referenceLabel}}:</strong> {{data.referenceValue}}<br>{{/if}}
        <strong>BG in favour of:</strong> {{data.beneficiaryName}}<br>
        <strong>BG address:</strong> {{data.beneficiaryAddress}}<br>
        <strong>BG Expiry Date:</strong> {{data.bgExpiryDate}}<br>
        <strong>BG Claim Date:</strong> {{data.claimDate}}<br>
        <strong>Amount:</strong> Rs. {{data.amount}}<br>
        <strong>BG Stamp paper value:</strong> Rs. {{data.stampPaperValue}}
    </p>

    <p><strong>Beneficiary account details</strong></p>
    <p>
        <strong>Beneficiary Name:</strong> {{data.beneName}}<br>
        <strong>Account No.:</strong> {{data.beneAcc}}<br>
        <strong>IFSC code:</strong> {{data.beneIfsc}}<br>
        <strong>Unique Code:</strong> {{data.uniqueCode}}
    </p>

    <p>This BG is required within {{data.timeLimit}} hours.</p>

    <p>
        Please go through the BG format once. If it is fine, send the request to the bank here:
        <a href="{{data.stage1Link}}">Stage 1: Request to Bank</a>. If any correction is needed, reject the request and
        mention what needs to be changed.
    </p>

    <p>
        Once the BG is ready, please courier it to the address below. Keep enough margin for courier transit so that it
        reaches before <strong>{{data.dueDateTime}}</strong>, and share the soft copy of the BG, the docket slip and the
        SFMS confirmation with us here: <a href="{{data.actionLink}}">{{data.actionLinkText}}</a>, or from your
        dashboard.
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Courier Address:</strong><br>
        {{data.courierAddress}}
    </p>

    <p>Please attach the covering letter with the BG when you courier it.</p>

    <p style="font-style: italic;">"Ensuring timely operations is the only source of growth."</p>

    <p>
        Regards,<br>
        {{data.senderName}},<br>
        Approved By Team Leader
    </p>

    {{#if data.attachmentLinks.length}}
    <p><strong>Documents</strong></p>
    <ul>
        {{#each data.attachmentLinks}}
        <li><a href="{{this.url}}">{{this.label}}</a></li>
        {{/each}}
    </ul>
    {{/if}}
</div>
